      "updated": 1746567008953,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tool is a bash OS command that overlays a standard \nOS command to provide relevant information about the \nworkspace. It is a wrapper script for kbox command that \ncalls k8shelld to perform relevant action.",
